      "page": "b",
      "text": "B, night and day\n\n1. Press the sun (or the moon) in the header, on any board. Best seen in Play.\n2. The day comes in from the east, over the Red Sea: a soft light line sweeps across the Earth with a sun flare, the words and logo turn dark, the routes draw again in deep turquoise. The night goes back the same way.\n3. The day photo is a Gemini edit of the night photo, so the flows stay where they were.\n4. Become a Partner added beside Talk to our team (your yes).\n5. Tweaks: Theme (starting look), Shade, Motion."
    },
